OL,3,GNEWSADiana fountain shut all summer by
OL,4,Atechnical fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Diana Memorial Fountain in Hyde
OL,7,FPark - which has long been a popular
OL,8,Fplace to cool down in hot weather - has
OL,9,Fbeen kept dry all summer due to a
OL,10,Ftechnical fault.
OL,12,FRoyal Parks, the charity that maintains
OL,13,Fthe central London park, apologised to
OL,14,Fvisitors who found it without water
OL,15,F"particularly given the prolonged high
OL,16,Ftemperatures we've been experiencing".
OL,18,FThe fountain opened in 2004 in memory
OL,19,Fof Diana, Princess of Wales who died
OL,20,Fnearly seven years earlier.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
