OL,3,GNEWSADiana fountain shut all summer by
OL,4,Atechnical fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure was initially triggered by
OL,7,Fa mechanical breakdown in the pump that
OL,8,Fdraws water from the local borehole.
OL,9,FThe pump was fixed, but software used
OL,10,Fto control the system then failed,
OL,11,Fpreventing the water supply from being
OL,12,Frestored.
